[
  {
    "id": "5fce40a6fa720026",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Tesla BMS",
    "disabled": false,
    "env": [
      {
        "name": "TESLABMS_FLOW_VERSION",
        "value": "v26.14",
        "type": "str"
      }
    ],
    "info": "Claude Tesla BMS (TeslaBMS_Victron) - reads the JSON telemetry of the Teensy via USB.\n\n1. On the Teensy: serial monitor, menu s -> m -> j (JSON on), q to save.\n2. Check the serial port (default /dev/ttyACM0) in the 'Teensy USB' config node.\n3. Needs node-red-node-serialport and @flowfuse/node-red-dashboard (Dashboard 2.0).\n4. The port is found automatically (top of the flow); VE_SERVICE=ignore is set automatically.\n5. Already have a Dashboard 2.0 base/theme? Then point the page 'Tesla BMS' at your own base and delete the imported ones."
  },
